/**
 * Economics, Sociology but also Land as Knowledge domains
 * 
 * Landcover/land use should be in here as knowledge if we still 
 * @agency should be important here
 */
ontology society
	version 1.0
	using imod, life, agency
	in domain imod:Physical;
	
// TODO check out FAIR population/demography vocabularies from https://zenodo.org/records/7818157
// FIXME remove the `deliberative` etc. keywords
// use agency:Participant roles according to what the individual is doing, not here
// 
// TODO default observer should be an `agency:Volitional society:HumanIndividual` or an Institution if 
// federated
agent HumanIndividual
	is life:Human life:Individual;

// TODO also. Here for the default observer - Volitional Institution w/ name of federation
agent Institution;